{"run": "digest", "t": 35918, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Disasters and accidents] 2026 Budhi Gandaki flood — Ten people are reported missing and at least 35 houses and six bridges are swept away in a major flash flood in Gorkha District, Gandaki Province, Nepal. The exact number of casualties is unknown."}
