{"run": "digest", "t": 35918, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Disasters and accidents] One person is killed and around 19 others are injured, including four critically, when a passenger bus plunges down a slope and crashes into a residential complex in Valparaíso, Chile."}
{"run": "digest", "t": 35918, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Health and environment] 2026 Ebola epidemic — The Kenyan health ministry reports that no Ebola cases have been reported since one patient died from the disease on October 5, with 293 tests conducted."}
{"run": "digest", "t": 35918, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Health and environment] 2026 Indonesia wildfires — The Indonesian forestry ministry and International Animal Rescue release eight orangutans rescued from wildfires into a protected wildforest in West Kalimantan after fires destroyed habitat near plantations."}
{"run": "digest", "t": 35918, "kind": "dbg", "msg": "wiki: NOT COVERED [Politics and elections] Insurgency in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa — Pakistani president Asif Ali Zardari declares a state of emergency in Khyber Pakhtunkhwa and suspends its provincial government amid disputes over the province's response to Islamist militancy."}
